Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.65,0:00:04.32,Style1,,0,0,0,,This is the weather forecast for the\NTokyo area, as released at 1 PM...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.44,0:00:07.53,Style1,,0,0,0,,...by the Meteorological Agency's\NForecasting Department.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.65,0:00:13.41,Style1,,0,0,0,,As of 11 AM on the 21st, the large\Nand powerful Typhoon 32...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.54,0:00:15.45,Style1,,0,0,0,,...was in the southernmost parts\Nof Shizuoka Prefecture...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.54,0:00:19.71,Style1,,0,0,0,,...heading northeast\Nat speeds of 45kph.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.79,0:00:23.21,Style1,,0,0,0,,Everyone is advised to\Nuse extreme caution...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.98,0:00:47.11,Style1,,0,0,0,,Its winds are presently in\Nthe 54kph range...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.19,0:00:52.78,Style1,,0,0,0,,...and caution is advised for the\NTokyo Metropolitan Area...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.39,0:01:17.85,Style2,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Let's chase our dreams...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.97,0:01:23.06,Style2,,0,0,0,,{\i1}... holding hearts burning...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.15,0:01:27.48,Style2,,0,0,0,,{\i1}... like the summer sunshine.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.57,0:01:31.40,Style2,,0,0,0,,{\i1}If we have courage...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.53,0:01:34.57,Style2,,0,0,0,,{\i1}... at 100 miles an hour...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.70,0:01:42.67,Style2,,0,0,0,,{\i1}... I'm sure the door will open.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.79,0:01:49.84,Style2,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Since sadness is the road{\i0}\N{\i1}that leads to smiles...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.88,0:01:58.56,Style2,,0,0,0,,{\i1}... dull, dingy shoes will{\i0}\N{\i1}start to shine, too.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.64,0:02:05.23,Style2,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The most wonderful dream{\i0}\N{\i1}in the world...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.36,0:02:11.86,Style2,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The pounding beat speeds up.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.99,0:02:19.04,Style2,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The eyes are prisms that{\i0}\N{\i1}catch the wind...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.16,0:02:26.96,Style2,,0,0,0,,{\i1}... and in the voices of{\i0}\N{\i1}countless friends...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.09,0:02:33.80,Style2,,0,0,0,,{\i1}... I feel happiness.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.76,0:02:39.28,Sign,,0,0,0,,{\an7\pos(367.71,573.43)}TOKYO TYPHOON RALLY
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.61,0:02:52.61,Style1,,0,0,0,,Oh, man, I've had it. It's been\Nlike this every week this year.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.15,0:02:56.49,Style1,,0,0,0,,Nothing we can do about it. We're up\Nagainst Mother Nature, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.66,0:02:59.12,Style1,,0,0,0,,Oooh! This summer I was sure I was\Ngonna lose a little more weight...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.20,0:03:02.08,Style1,,0,0,0,,...take on a 1-kg parfait, heft the\NSumida Festival palanquin...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.16,0:03:03.33,Style1,,0,0,0,,...and at the night stalls, buy apple candy\Nand fried octopus balls in seaweed...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.45,0:03:04.87,Style1,,0,0,0,,...and baked corn and\Nfresh radish pickles...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.96,0:03:06.46,Style1,,0,0,0,,...and go goldfish-catching and balloon\Ndart-throwing and target shooting...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.58,0:03:08.54,Style1,,0,0,0,,...and shelltops... and then, uh,\Nbrown sugar candy, oh, hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.63,0:03:10.63,Style1,,0,0,0,,Okay, okay. We're moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.51,0:03:17.09,Style1,,0,0,0,,Aw, there's no point\Nto anything now...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.22,0:03:19.76,Style1,,0,0,0,,Hmh? Miyuki, pull\Nover to the left.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.97,0:03:21.81,Style1,,0,0,0,,Huh? Okay...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.89,0:03:24.52,Style1,,0,0,0,,Students of Wakaba Preschool, please\Ngo straight home immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.64,0:03:29.81,Style1,,0,0,0,,Don't go anywhere else. There's\Na scary typhoon on the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.27,0:03:33.11,Style1,,0,0,0,,Wow! It's Natsumi!\NIt's Miyuki!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.32,0:03:34.36,Style1,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.53,0:03:38.41,Style1,,0,0,0,,What's with this "Natsumi" stuff?\NThat's "Miss Natsumi" to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.57,0:03:40.62,Style1,,0,0,0,,Well, your name is\NNatsumi, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.78,0:03:41.78,Style1,,0,0,0,,Ri-ight?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.99,0:03:43.75,Style1,,0,0,0,,It's enough for us to call\Nyou Natsumi, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.23,0:03:44.70,Style1,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.70,0:03:48.08,Style1,,0,0,0,,Hey, hey, Miyuki, do you know where\Nthere's an animal hospital?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.25,0:03:52.30,Style1,,0,0,0,,Huh? A vet? I'm not sure if\Nthere is one in this area...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.46,0:03:54.21,Style1,,0,0,0,,You don't even know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.38,0:03:56.97,Style1,,0,0,0,,Some policewoman\Nyou are.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.93,0:04:04.64,Sign,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HFFFFFF&\pos(1057.14,73.14)\c&H000000&\bord3}Preschool
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.81,0:04:07.48,Style1,,0,0,0,,Huh? Isn't that Chibi?\NYou sure got big.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.69,0:04:09.40,Style1,,0,0,0,,Do you know this\Ncat, Natsumi?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.56,0:04:13.57,Style1,,0,0,0,,Hey, how do you know?\NHuh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.73,0:04:18.49,Style1,,0,0,0,,There is nothing that Natsumi the hero\Ndoesn't know. Are you impressed?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.65,0:04:21.37,Style1,,0,0,0,,You can't\Nfool us with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.49,0:04:25.58,Style1,,0,0,0,,Don't\Nbelittle the masses!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.75,0:04:28.25,Style1,,0,0,0,,What's going on? Are you\Nkeeping her, Maho?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.41,0:04:31.00,Style1,,0,0,0,,Uh-uh. She came to the preschool\Na little while ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.21,0:04:34.05,Style1,,0,0,0,,She's not feeling well. She\Ndoesn't eat anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.38,0:04:37.09,Style1,,0,0,0,,So that's why you wanted to take\Nher to the hospital, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.26,0:04:37.80,Style1,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.97,0:04:39.38,Style1,,0,0,0,,I get it now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.55,0:04:40.68,Style1,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's Ken!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.84,0:04:46.64,Style1,,0,0,0,,Kennie's here! Kennie's here!\NKennie's on his motorcycle!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.72,0:04:47.98,Style1,,0,0,0,,Kennie! Kennie! Kennie!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.14,0:04:51.52,Style1,,0,0,0,,Oh, so Nakajima is "Kennie"\Naround here?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.69,0:04:52.65,Style1,,0,0,0,,Sort of...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.98,0:04:58.19,Style1,,0,0,0,,What's this? She's\Nawfully fat...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.40,0:05:01.24,Style1,,0,0,0,,Stop that! You've got\Nto hold her properly.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.95,0:05:03.95,Style1,,0,0,0,,Oh, uh, I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.08,0:05:05.79,Style1,,0,0,0,,All right, we'll see that\Nshe's taken care of.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.95,0:05:06.87,Style1,,0,0,0,,Will she be okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.08,0:05:12.12,Style1,,0,0,0,,We'll take care of it. We promise.\NSo you all hurry home. Go on!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.93,0:05:21.76,Style1,,0,0,0,,Look out!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.68,0:05:29.27,Style1,,0,0,0,,Hey! Where'd you learn to drive?! Don't\Nmess around like that, you idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.43,0:05:31.81,Style1,,0,0,0,,Natsumi's scary!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.77,0:05:34.90,Style1,,0,0,0,,That Lancia... it's\Ngot to be!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.06,0:05:37.02,Style1,,0,0,0,,Umm... Nakajima...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.95,0:05:50.58,Style1,,0,0,0,,I'm now going to catch\Nthat ill-mannered car!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.79,0:05:56.92,Style1,,0,0,0,,So take care, everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.88,0:06:01.63,Style1,,0,0,0,,Oh, he fell over!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.80,0:06:03.76,Style1,,0,0,0,,That GSX...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.98,0:06:20.90,Style1,,0,0,0,,I see, I see. I knew it all the time,\Nuh-huh, uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.07,0:06:25.11,Style1,,0,0,0,,Oh, cut it out, Natsumi. You're\Njust jeering at us both.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.24,0:06:26.74,Style1,,0,0,0,,You're no better than\Nthose preschoolers.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.87,0:06:30.24,Style1,,0,0,0,,Thanks to whom, we blew our\Nchance to catch that Lancia!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.41,0:06:34.62,Style1,,0,0,0,,Well, well, nice change of subject.\NWon't work on me, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.12,0:06:36.75,Style1,,0,0,0,,Natsumi!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.92,0:06:38.21,Style1,,0,0,0,,Welcome back!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.34,0:06:40.46,Style1,,0,0,0,,You're done for the day, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.63,0:06:42.30,Style1,,0,0,0,,Yeah. We've done\Nour nightshift.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.63,0:06:45.80,Style1,,0,0,0,,Hey, hey, Nakajima's looking\Na little funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.89,0:06:47.14,Style1,,0,0,0,,You know anything\Nabout it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.30,0:06:49.31,Style1,,0,0,0,,Oh! Not you too, Yoriko!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.35,0:06:56.81,Style1,,0,0,0,,Something DID happen,\Ndidn't it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.02,0:06:58.15,Style1,,0,0,0,,It sure did!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.41,0:07:10.28,Style1,,0,0,0,,I guess this will do for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.33,0:07:14.66,Style1,,0,0,0,,But you know, Nakajima\Ndidn't look at all happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.75,0:07:17.58,Style1,,0,0,0,,He just went and locked\Nhimself in the morgue.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.75,0:07:19.25,Style1,,0,0,0,,I bet he was just blushing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.42,0:07:20.46,Style1,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.54,0:07:22.71,Style1,,0,0,0,,Are you gonna have kittens?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.88,0:07:23.67,Style1,,0,0,0,,Eh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.84,0:07:25.51,Style1,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah! Her breasts are big!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.68,0:07:27.34,Style1,,0,0,0,,That's why she's so listless!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.55,0:07:29.22,Style1,,0,0,0,,So that's it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.68,0:07:31.51,Style1,,0,0,0,,Kobayakawa!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.81,0:07:34.52,Style1,,0,0,0,,I need to ask you something.\NPlease come!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.02,0:07:36.98,Style1,,0,0,0,,Uh... Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.19,0:07:40.98,Style1,,0,0,0,,Hey, hey, "something\Nto ask" must be!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.15,0:07:43.57,Style1,,0,0,0,,A proposal. It's got to be!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.73,0:07:46.32,Style1,,0,0,0,,Who'd have thought they'd\Nhave gotten that close!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.49,0:07:47.45,Style1,,0,0,0,,It's a big scoop.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.61,0:07:48.49,Style1,,0,0,0,,We're tagging along, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.66,0:07:49.20,Style1,,0,0,0,,Oh, let's.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.37,0:07:51.20,Style1,,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.71,0:08:04.59,Style1,,0,0,0,,The rain's pouring down so loud, I can't\Nhear what they're talking about at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.76,0:08:07.38,Style1,,0,0,0,,Who cares what they're talking about?\NIt's actions that matter!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.51,0:08:09.18,Style1,,0,0,0,,Go! Go get 'er, Nakajima!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.43,0:08:13.56,Style1,,0,0,0,,You're the only one I can\Nask this of. I beg you!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.72,0:08:16.56,Style1,,0,0,0,,For something like that,\NI'll gladly assist you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.64,0:08:21.27,Style1,,0,0,0,,And besides, there are a couple others\Nwho look like they'll help... right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.79,0:08:41.79,Style1,,0,0,0,,Natsumi! Bring that toolbox!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.96,0:08:43.25,Style1,,0,0,0,,Uh, right!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.79,0:08:47.01,Style1,,0,0,0,,Yoriko! There's an auxiliary flashing\Nlight and radio! Bring them here!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.17,0:08:47.82,Style1,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Uh, right!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.72,0:08:49.63,Style1,,0,0,0,,Natsumi, I need a speaker too!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.55,0:08:50.59,Style1,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Huh? Where is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.59,0:08:52.01,Style1,,0,0,0,,On the highest shelf in the back!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.01,0:08:54.18,Style1,,0,0,0,,Okay, here you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.31,0:08:55.63,Style1,,0,0,0,,Now get me some grease.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.47,0:08:56.62,Style1,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Uh, right, right!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.56,0:09:02.48,Style1,,0,0,0,,I'm pooped.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.65,0:09:03.36,Style1,,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.32,0:09:06.48,Style1,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.65,0:09:08.32,Style1,,0,0,0,,Thanks for doing\Nthis all for me...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.49,0:09:11.91,Style1,,0,0,0,,Uh-uh, no problem. I can't do\Nanything useful anyway...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.07,0:09:14.66,Style1,,0,0,0,,But I'm a little disappointed,\Nyou know?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.83,0:09:19.96,Style1,,0,0,0,,So this is what your request turned\Nout to be? Oh, and we were sure...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.12,0:09:21.75,Style1,,0,0,0,,Huh? What did you\Nthink it was?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.12,0:09:25.17,Style1,,0,0,0,,Eh? Uh, well, um...\NNever mind that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.29,0:09:27.96,Style1,,0,0,0,,Are you really going to go out there\Nusing a..."KLE," was it...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.05,0:09:29.22,Style1,,0,0,0,,...as a police motorcycle?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.34,0:09:33.18,Style1,,0,0,0,,Even you wouldn't stand a chance in\Nthe middle of a typhoon like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.34,0:09:37.18,Style1,,0,0,0,,I know it's risky. I have\Nmy reasons...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.79,0:10:02.08,Style1,,0,0,0,,What condition are\Nthe victims in?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.25,0:10:05.67,Style1,,0,0,0,,I don't know, but the ambulance\Nshould already be on its way.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.84,0:10:08.84,Style1,,0,0,0,,Tell Nakajima that the\Nbike's finished.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.05,0:10:10.51,Style1,,0,0,0,,And see that the cat gets fed.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.71,0:10:12.01,Style1,,0,0,0,,Cat food and water, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.08,0:10:50.71,Style1,,0,0,0,,I used to enjoy typhoons,\Nyou know?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.92,0:10:53.72,Style1,,0,0,0,,Now we can't just enjoy\Nthem, can we?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.56,0:11:06.94,Style1,,0,0,0,,Mini Patrol Four calling Bokuto Station!\NHow long before the ambulance arrives?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.48,0:11:10.73,Style1,,0,0,0,,Well... the roads are badly flooded,\Nand it seems to be taking a detour.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.86,0:11:12.94,Style1,,0,0,0,,Looks like it'll take another\Nten minutes or so.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.11,0:11:15.20,Style1,,0,0,0,,Roger! We'll figure something\Nout! Miyuki!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.36,0:11:16.32,Style1,,0,0,0,,I know!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.87,0:11:24.25,Style1,,0,0,0,,It's gonna be all right now.\NNatsumi! Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.41,0:11:26.46,Style1,,0,0,0,,It's locked! Hang on a sec!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.38,0:11:31.00,Style1,,0,0,0,,Wha?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.17,0:11:32.88,Style1,,0,0,0,,Now that it's come to this...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.38,0:11:37.09,Style1,,0,0,0,,...we can only exercise\Nbrute force!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.18,0:11:39.64,Style1,,0,0,0,,Here we go...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.72,0:11:41.64,Style1,,0,0,0,,DIAMOND KNUCKLE ATTACK!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.81,0:11:44.68,Style1,,0,0,0,,I'm through.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.44,0:11:48.44,Style1,,0,0,0,,Oh wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.70,0:12:05.83,Style1,,0,0,0,,The watermelons are\Nall taken care of.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.00,0:12:07.00,Style1,,0,0,0,,Nice going. Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.16,0:12:09.17,Style1,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.96,0:12:12.88,Style1,,0,0,0,,So what was the cause?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.05,0:12:15.01,Style1,,0,0,0,,Well, you see...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.13,0:12:18.09,Style1,,0,0,0,,A Lancia Delta? Then the\None this afternoon?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.26,0:12:21.55,Style1,,0,0,0,,Probably... in which case, it's\Njust as Nakajima feared...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.80,0:12:24.64,Style1,,0,0,0,,Eh? What does "Kennie"\Nhave to do with it? Ow...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.52,0:12:31.19,Style1,,0,0,0,,It seems it appears every year at this\Ntime, only on days with typhoons...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.31,0:12:34.53,Style1,,0,0,0,,...a legendary car that runs through\Ntown like it owned the place.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.69,0:12:36.65,Style1,,0,0,0,,Then, you mean, a year ago?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.82,0:12:38.61,Style1,,0,0,0,,Yes... through some\Nhappenstance...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.70,0:12:42.41,Style1,,0,0,0,,...Nakajima met up with\Nand challenged it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.57,0:12:44.83,Style1,,0,0,0,,And he lost, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.99,0:12:47.75,Style1,,0,0,0,,The bike was a serious handicap! He\Nwas up against four-wheel drive.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.87,0:12:51.88,Style1,,0,0,0,,And it was outfitted for rallying. Not\Neven Nakajima could beat that!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.21,0:12:55.00,Style1,,0,0,0,,So that's why he wanted the KLE 500\Nwith foul-weather outfitting.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.09,0:12:57.38,Style1,,0,0,0,,That's Nakajima for you; he doesn't\Nlike to lose, does he?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.97,0:13:02.93,Style1,,0,0,0,,It's not just that. The Lancia's reckless\Ndriving escalates each year.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.05,0:13:05.85,Style1,,0,0,0,,Fact is, it didn't cause any accidents\Nup until last year.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.93,0:13:08.35,Style1,,0,0,0,,If left alone at the rate it's\Ngoing, next we'll have...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.15,0:13:13.06,Style1,,0,0,0,,Yes, this is Mini Patrol\NFour. Go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.40,0:13:17.57,Style1,,0,0,0,,Natsumi, Miyuki, I don't know\Nwhat to do. Hurry back here!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.71,0:13:38.71,Style1,,0,0,0,,It won't eat, it makes weird high-pitched\Ncries... It just won't settle down!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.26,0:13:41.05,Style1,,0,0,0,,Aren't its kittens about\Nto be born?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.22,0:13:42.93,Style1,,0,0,0,,If so, it wouldn't be crying.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.09,0:13:45.10,Style1,,0,0,0,,Besides, it looks like\Nit's in a lot of pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.22,0:13:48.68,Style1,,0,0,0,,I thought of calling a veterinarian,\Nbut there's all the wind and rain...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.02,0:13:52.98,Style1,,0,0,0,,We can't very well wait for the typhoon\Nto pass. Natsumi! Get things ready!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.15,0:13:55.52,Style1,,0,0,0,,All right! Leave it to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.03,0:14:05.57,Style1,,0,0,0,,Where? Say again!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.78,0:14:09.50,Style1,,0,0,0,,Saitoo Animal Hospital, 7-4\NMorishita-cho, Sumida-ku.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.62,0:14:12.54,Style1,,0,0,0,,They stop examining patients at five,\Nbut they said they'd have a look.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.71,0:14:13.67,Style1,,0,0,0,,Roger.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.63,0:14:22.93,Style1,,0,0,0,,Animal hospital? What\Nare those two up to?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.78,0:14:50.79,Style1,,0,0,0,,This is Bokuto Station.\NGo ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.95,0:14:53.62,Style1,,0,0,0,,Yoriko? What are Kobayakawa\Nand Tsujimoto doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.87,0:14:55.96,Style1,,0,0,0,,Oh, Nakajima, you see...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.17,0:14:57.92,Style1,,0,0,0,,Blackout!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.09,0:15:00.09,Style1,,0,0,0,,People will start mobbing the phone\Nlines. Get someone on it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.25,0:15:01.26,Style1,,0,0,0,,The circuit's holding!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.57,0:15:03.13,Style1,,0,0,0,,Hey! Yoriko!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.58,0:15:37.92,Style1,,0,0,0,,Looks like a breech birth. On top of\Nwhich, her pelvis seems narrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.08,0:15:40.09,Style1,,0,0,0,,Well, what do we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.50,0:15:43.63,Style1,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, but with things the\Nway they are right now...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.38,0:15:46.59,Style1,,0,0,0,,Not much you can do in\Na blackout, is there?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.59,0:15:50.26,Style1,,0,0,0,,Let me see if I can contact the\NVeterinarians' Association.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.39,0:15:52.18,Style1,,0,0,0,,I think there'll be a place somewhere\Nthat will take her in.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.89,0:15:55.18,Style1,,0,0,0,,Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.65,0:16:02.15,Style1,,0,0,0,,We didn't hear anything about a blackout.\NTell us these things ahead of time!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.73,0:16:07.15,Style1,,0,0,0,,Sorry. But things were all messed up\Nhere, too. They still are, though...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.74,0:16:10.91,Style1,,0,0,0,,Where was that hospital\Nthe vet referred us to?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.99,0:16:14.45,Style1,,0,0,0,,Ayase, in Adachi-ku. We can work it out\Nif we get to the Kosuge Interchange.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.08,0:16:17.92,Style1,,0,0,0,,Oh, Capital Expressway Six is\Nclosed due to construction!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.08,0:16:22.29,Style1,,0,0,0,,Why you! You should tell us\Nthings like that beforehand!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.46,0:16:25.38,Style1,,0,0,0,,Aww, it happened\Nthree days ago!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.55,0:16:28.55,Style1,,0,0,0,,If it's closed, that means no\None's driving on it... right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.34,0:16:30.80,Style1,,0,0,0,,Is... that so?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.68,0:16:35.68,Style1,,0,0,0,,Mini Patrol Four is now en route to Ayase.\NWe will be taking Capital Expressway Six!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.85,0:16:38.60,Style1,,0,0,0,,What! Are you serious? That's...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.77,0:16:41.48,Style1,,0,0,0,,Over and out! So long!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.69,0:16:45.90,Sign,,0,0,0,,{\pos(720,103.14)\c&H6E7567&}ENTRANCE
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.11,0:16:49.19,Sign,,0,0,0,,{\pos(720,252.86)\c&H695E8E&}NO TRESPASSING\N{\c&H6C5D61&}Bokuto Police Station
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.74,0:16:53.08,Style1,,0,0,0,,The wind's really hellacious!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.24,0:16:55.04,Style1,,0,0,0,,Feels like we're gonna\Nget swept away!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.12,0:16:59.25,Style1,,0,0,0,,Driving in this rain and crosswind\Nis a life-threatening proposition.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.33,0:17:00.79,Style1,,0,0,0,,If you're getting out, do it now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.00,0:17:04.42,Style1,,0,0,0,,Looking to get it all to yourself?\NThat's not fair.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.55,0:17:06.46,Style1,,0,0,0,,This is where the fun begins.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.55,0:17:07.80,Style1,,0,0,0,,Roger!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.15,0:17:30.24,Style1,,0,0,0,,We're almost there. Hang on!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.40,0:17:31.61,Style1,,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.78,0:17:33.24,Style1,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.45,0:17:37.62,Style1,,0,0,0,,I thought it was a little bit strange, to see\Nsuch a gentle expression on your face.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.50,0:17:40.50,Style1,,0,0,0,,What're you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.62,0:17:44.63,Style1,,0,0,0,,It's much stranger for you to be doing\Nsomething this outrageous!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.38,0:17:47.13,Style1,,0,0,0,,That makes us even, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.38,0:17:49.17,Style1,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.17,0:17:50.35,Style1,,0,0,0,,There's a car behind us!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.76,0:17:51.40,Style1,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.10,0:17:58.85,Style1,,0,0,0,,What the?! It's that Lancia Delta!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.04,0:17:59.93,Style1,,0,0,0,,I know!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.93,0:18:01.56,Style1,,0,0,0,,Of all the times it could\Npick to show up!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.73,0:18:04.02,Style1,,0,0,0,,He's not likely to let us\Ngo by quietly, is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.78,0:18:17.83,Style1,,0,0,0,,He's out of his mind! Miyuki, blow\Nhim away with the nitro!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.33,0:18:20.20,Style1,,0,0,0,,That's impossible in\Nthese conditions!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.33,0:18:22.75,Style1,,0,0,0,,It's too dangerous with this wind\Nand this poor visibility!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.83,0:18:25.00,Style1,,0,0,0,,Besides...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.17,0:18:28.67,Style1,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah. There's no telling\Nwhether Chibi could take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.56,0:18:47.23,Style1,,0,0,0,,Miyuki! Get off at Tsutsumi Avenue!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.23,0:18:47.90,Style1,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.07,0:18:50.07,Style1,,0,0,0,,Let the Lancia Delta\Npass us by.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.19,0:18:51.94,Style1,,0,0,0,,At this rate, he'll mess\Nyou up, Miyuki!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.07,0:18:54.78,Style1,,0,0,0,,Even if he follows us, we'll have the edge\Ndown below. We'll figure something out.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.95,0:18:55.91,Style1,,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.91,0:19:04.16,Style1,,0,0,0,,He's got us figured! He's\Nnot going to let us off!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.33,0:19:05.29,Style1,,0,0,0,,Goddamn!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.92,0:19:14.26,Style1,,0,0,0,,He's a little better than I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.42,0:19:15.63,Style1,,0,0,0,,Miyuki...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.72,0:19:18.97,Style1,,0,0,0,,What do we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.81,0:19:22.43,Style1,,0,0,0,,Mini Patrol Four, do\Nyou read me?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.60,0:19:23.89,Style1,,0,0,0,,Nakajima?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.52,0:19:25.94,Style1,,0,0,0,,Where are you, Nakajima?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.10,0:19:27.44,Style1,,0,0,0,,Right in front of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.07,0:19:34.82,Style1,,0,0,0,,Yoriko filled me in.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.95,0:19:36.66,Style1,,0,0,0,,You're carrying a patient, so you must\Nbe having a hard time fighting him.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.78,0:19:37.91,Style1,,0,0,0,,I'll back you up.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.12,0:19:40.37,Style1,,0,0,0,,Kennie! You're so cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.87,0:19:40.83,Style1,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Stop that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.37,0:19:48.92,Style1,,0,0,0,,I'm the one who's taking you\Non! Come and get me!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.96,0:19:56.30,Style1,,0,0,0,,Kobayakawa! It's only\N5 km to Kosuge!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.38,0:20:00.01,Style1,,0,0,0,,Get into his slipstream and follow us!\NHis car should act as a windbreak!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.18,0:20:03.35,Style1,,0,0,0,,Will you be all right, Nakajima? Bikes are\Nthe most dangerous in this weather!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.68,0:20:07.27,Style1,,0,0,0,,I put my faith in this bike\Nyou tuned, Kobayakawa.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.34,0:20:43.35,Style1,,0,0,0,,Oh, man! We've already reached\Nthe Kosuge offramp!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.43,0:20:46.77,Style1,,0,0,0,,Hey, hey, Miyuki, you've fallen for\N"Kennie" all over again, I bet.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.98,0:20:49.77,Style1,,0,0,0,,Look, I told you to stop referring\Nto him like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.94,0:20:53.11,Style1,,0,0,0,,Well, how about Kenbo? Ken-Ken?\NKensuke? The Kenster?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.19,0:20:55.23,Style1,,0,0,0,,"Kennie" really is best,\Ndon't you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.36,0:20:56.82,Style1,,0,0,0,,Oh! It's from "Kennie!"
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.03,0:20:58.99,Style1,,0,0,0,,This is where we\Npart for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.11,0:21:02.49,Style1,,0,0,0,,I'll join you after I take\Ncare of this clown.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.57,0:21:04.53,Style1,,0,0,0,,Take care of that\Nchubby Chibi.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.29,0:21:13.08,Style1,,0,0,0,,I wonder if he can win out.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.25,0:21:16.05,Style1,,0,0,0,,Sure he can! He will! Kennie\Ncan if anyone can!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.26,0:21:21.26,Style1,,0,0,0,,Natsumi! You keep saying, "Kennie,\NKennie," and now I'm doing it, too...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.43,0:21:24.72,Style1,,0,0,0,,What's wrong with that? You're gonna\Nbe calling him that sooner or later!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.93,0:21:28.02,Style1,,0,0,0,,How can you say that! Don't decide\Nsuch things by yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.27,0:21:30.94,Style1,,0,0,0,,Whatever! Keep your\Neyes on the road!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.10,0:21:32.18,Style1,,0,0,0,,Don't try to evade the subject!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.18,0:21:33.90,Style1,,0,0,0,,We're gonna crash!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.61,0:21:41.45,Style1,,0,0,0,,I repeat...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.57,0:21:45.91,Style1,,0,0,0,,...the Joban Line is currently halted\Nwithin the Tokyo city limits.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.49,0:21:53.00,Style1,,0,0,0,,It is unclear when service\Nwill be reestablished.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.93,0:22:09.31,Style1,,0,0,0,,Right at the next corner. Then\Nleft about 300m after that!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.47,0:22:10.39,Style1,,0,0,0,,Roger!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.85,0:22:15.73,Style1,,0,0,0,,Hang in there! It's just\Na little longer!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.69,0:22:21.65,Style1,,0,0,0,,You bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.45,0:22:25.62,Style1,,0,0,0,,Ah-ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.70,0:22:33.33,Style1,,0,0,0,,I'm not like I was last year!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.72,0:22:43.26,Style1,,0,0,0,,We can't get through here!\NWhere's a detour?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.47,0:22:48.64,Style1,,0,0,0,,Hold on... Back up and go left on that last\Nroad... no good! Neither is going right!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.10,0:22:49.81,Style1,,0,0,0,,Which way?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.81,0:22:51.81,Style1,,0,0,0,,Mmm... there is no way.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.85,0:22:53.10,Style1,,0,0,0,,Eh?! It can't be!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.27,0:22:56.77,Style1,,0,0,0,,With this much water, it's all the same\Nno matter which way you go!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.98,0:22:59.48,Style1,,0,0,0,,Getting around this will mean\Ngoing way out of our way.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.65,0:23:03.99,Style1,,0,0,0,,Which means we only have one option\Nleft... Natsumi, you're on!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.15,0:23:06.24,Style1,,0,0,0,,I had a feeling it would\Ncome to this.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.49,0:23:14.29,Style1,,0,0,0,,All set. Natsumi, this\Nis the final hurdle.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.75,0:23:18.13,Style1,,0,0,0,,No problem. My bike technique\Ncan stand up to this typhoon!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.00,0:23:19.96,Style1,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.09,0:23:24.05,Style1,,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.38,0:24:04.34,Style1,,0,0,0,,I've got something to say\Nto you. Listen up!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.55,0:24:06.93,Style1,,0,0,0,,When driving near children,\Nmaintain a safe distance...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.05,0:24:10.01,Style1,,0,0,0,,...and furthermore, go slowly!\NRemember that.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.45,0:24:34.66,Style2,,0,0,0,,"Animal Hospital"
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.62,0:25:21.92,Style2,,0,0,0,,"This is a present for good children.\NPick it up gently."
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.41,0:25:58.24,Style2,,0,0,0,,"Miss Natsumi, Miss Miyuki,\NThank You"
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.53,0:26:36.87,Style2,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I love the smile you always have.{\i0}\N{\i1}With all the passion I have...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.95,0:26:46.29,Style2,,0,0,0,,{\i1}... I will protect you from sighs.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.38,0:26:54.30,Style2,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The sunset skyline flashes past{\i0}\N{\i1}in my side-view mirror.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.38,0:27:01.85,Style2,,0,0,0,,{\i1}This is the road I drive on every day,{\i0}\N{\i1}believing in my dreams.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.98,0:27:09.77,Style2,,0,0,0,,{\i1}On rainy days, windy days, and days{\i0}\N{\i1}when I wanted to throw it all away...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.90,0:27:17.53,Style2,,0,0,0,,{\i1}... you smiled as you{\i0}\N{\i1}sat beside me.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.83,0:27:23.33,Style2,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I love the unchanging vista, the sky{\i0}\N{\i1}that we watch together.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.33,0:27:34.13,Style2,,0,0,0,,{\i1}That's why I'm confident that I can{\i0}\N{\i1}hang in there, if it's for you.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.22,0:27:42.60,Style2,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I love the smile you always have.{\i0}\N{\i1}With all the passion I have...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.72,0:27:42.85,Style2,,0,0,0,,{\i1}... I will protect you from sighs.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.19,0:27:49.23,Style2,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I love this town where we{\i0}\N{\i1}happened to meet...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.73,0:27:57.03,Style1,,0,0,0,,Honestly, those kids... Miyuki,\Nthis isn't coming off!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.20,0:27:59.37,Style1,,0,0,0,,Look, just put some elbow\Ngrease into it.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.45,0:28:01.24,Style1,,0,0,0,,We'll clean her up even\Nif it takes all day.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.41,0:28:04.79,Style1,,0,0,0,,Eek! No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.68,0:28:07.93,Sign,,0,0,0,,{\pos(720,254)\c&HA35CFF&}THE TRUTH BEHIND\NTHE RUMORS
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.88,0:28:12.30,Style1,,0,0,0,,Why are you having a matchmaking, when\Nyou have someone like Nakajima?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.80,0:28:13.67,Style1,,0,0,0,,Want me to tell?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.67,0:28:15.92,Style1,,0,0,0,,Hey, who are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.09,0:28:19.05,Style1,,0,0,0,,Stop her, Nakajima! You're the\Nonly one who can stop Miyuki!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.22,0:28:20.93,Style1,,0,0,0,,Look, what are you\Ntalking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.10,0:28:21.76,Style1,,0,0,0,,Wanna know?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.93,0:28:24.39,Style1,,0,0,0,,You want her to be taken away by\Nsome nobody from nowhere?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.60,0:28:26.64,Style1,,0,0,0,,How did you come up\Nwith a story like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.81,0:28:27.85,Style1,,0,0,0,,Shall I tell you?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.02,0:28:29.77,Style1,,0,0,0,,So you're the cause of all this!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.98,0:28:33.27,Style1,,0,0,0,,You're Under Arrest, File 3,\N"Love's Highway Stars."
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.44,0:28:36.61,Sign,,0,0,0,,{\pos(720,632.29)}LOVE'S HIGHWAY STARS
